"<b>المفرد</b> يسبقه <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a</span> أو <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">an</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a screwdriver · an adapter</span>": "<b>Singular:</b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a</span> or <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">an</span> comes before it: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a screwdriver · an adapter</span>",
"المفرد": "Singular",
