"الجمع": "Plural",
"<b>التمييز:</b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">screw</span> له رأس وسن مدبب يدخل الخشب بالمفك، و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">bolt</span> طرفه مستوٍ يُشد بصامولة <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">nut</span>، و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">washer</span> حلقة توضع تحت الصامولة.": "<b>The difference:</b> a <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">screw</span> has a head and a sharp end; you turn it into wood with a screwdriver. A <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">bolt</span> has a flat end and goes into a <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">nut</span>. A <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">washer</span> is a ring that goes under the nut.",
