"<b>الرمز لا يُجمع</b> في الكتابة، لكننا نجمع الكلمة عند القراءة: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"ltr\">230 V</span> = two hundred and thirty volts</span>": "<b>The symbol has no plural</b> in writing, but we say the word in the plural: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"ltr\">230 V</span> = two hundred and thirty volts</span>",
