"أكمل:": "Complete:",
"3. الوقت بنظامي 24 و 12 ساعة <span class=\"ref\">ص 9</span>": "3. The 24-hour and 12-hour clock <span class=\"ref\">p. 9</span>",
"جداول الرحلات والعمل تكتب الوقت غالباً بنظام 24 ساعة، والناس يقولونه كثيراً بنظام 12 ساعة. فتحتاج أن تنتقل بينهما.": "Travel and work timetables often use the 24-hour clock, but people often say the time in the 12-hour clock. So you need to change between them.",
"<b>نظام 12 ساعة:</b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">am</span> قبل الظهر و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pm</span> بعده: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">14.40 = 2.40 pm</span>": "<b>12-hour clock:</b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">am</span> before midday and <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pm</span> after: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">14.40 = 2.40 pm</span>",
"نظام 12 ساعة:": "12-hour clock:",
"<b>القراءة:</b> الساعة ثم الدقائق: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">2.40 = two forty</span>": "<b>Reading:</b> the hour, then the minutes: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">2.40 = two forty</span>",
"<b>في نظام 24 ساعة</b> نقرأ الصفر <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">oh</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">09.05 = oh nine oh five</span>": "<b>In the 24-hour clock</b> we say zero as <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">oh</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">09.05 = oh nine oh five</span>",
"في نظام 24 ساعة": "In the 24-hour clock",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">12.00</span> = <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">twelve noon</span> أو <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">twelve o'clock</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">12.00</span> = <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">twelve noon</span> or <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">twelve o'clock</span>",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">am</span> قبل الظهر و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pm</span> بعده. وفي نظام 24 ساعة نقرأ الصفر <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">oh</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">09.05 = oh nine oh five</span>.": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">am</span> is before midday and <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pm</span> after. In the 24-hour clock we say zero as <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">oh</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">09.05 = oh nine oh five</span>.",
"مختبر مصغّر: الوقت بنظامين": "Mini lab: time in two systems",
"اختر وقتاً، وشاهده بنظام 24 ساعة و 12 ساعة، وطريقة قراءته.": "Choose a time. See it in the 24-hour and 12-hour clock, and how we read it.",
"الوقت": "Time",
"<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">am</span> قبل الظهر و <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pm</span> بعده. وفي نظام 24 ساعة نقرأ الصفر <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">oh</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">09.05 = oh nine oh five</span>": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">am</span> is before midday and <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pm</span> after. In the 24-hour clock we say zero as <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">oh</span>: <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">09.05 = oh nine oh five</span>",
